  "description": "YITAMOTOR approaches our products by examining them from the users’ perspective and acknowledging the weaknesses of other truck bed covers on the market. Thoroughly tested by professional engineers, YITAMOTOR truck bed covers feature a sleek look and durability to precisely fit your truck bed.\nFitment\n2014 Chevy Silverado & GMC Sierra 1500 Fleetside 5.8 ft Bed\n2015 Chevy Silverado & GMC Sierra 1500 Fleetside 5.8 ft Bed\n2016 Chevy Silverado & GMC Sierra 1500 Fleetside 5.8 ft Bed\n2017 Chevy Silverado & GMC Sierra 1500 Fleetside 5.8 ft Bed\n2018 Chevy Silverado & GMC Sierra 1500 Fleetside 5.8 ft Bed\nFeatures\nGreat Fit:\nReliable manufacture brand packaging; Each cover is custom-built to\nensure precise compatibility with the 5.8’ bed of 2014 2015 2016 2017\n2018 Chevrolet Silverado & GMC Sierra 1500(DO NOT FIT Multi-flex\ntailgate).\nEasy Installation: No tools or drilling required; Upgraded clamps with\nadjustable holes allow for an easy installation within 20 minutes; user\nfriendly design for easy assembly and dis-assembly.\nSafety First: Reinforced corner design keeps the cover tight to the\nbed; sturdy clamps and buckles with straps protect the cover from\nsliding or blowing off while driving.\nGreat Quality: Made with double layer PVC on the top, structured with\nsolid alloy in the frame, this back cover is build to last for your\ntruck.\nAll season Protection: Features tear resistant, water resistance, high\ntemperature resistance, no matter where you are or what the weather is\nlike, we’ve got you covered.",
